/*
  Cross-origin isolation is what gives the page SharedArrayBuffer, which the
  multi-threaded ffmpeg core needs. Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this file;
  Vercel reads vercel.json. GitHub Pages cannot set headers at all, so the app
  detects that and falls back to the single-threaded core there.
*/
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
*/